# StockPilot CODEOWNERS
#
# A reviewer path for every path: opening a pull request automatically requests
# a review from the maintainer(s) below, so no change — including a docs-only
# one — lands without a second set of eyes. GitHub requires write access on the
# default branch to be auto-requested via CODEOWNERS; until a second human
# contributor has write access, self-review is still possible once branch
# protection allows it (see docs/development/git-workflow.md §3).
#
# Format: <path-glob> <@owner> [@owner ...]. Last matching pattern wins.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
*                               @Kaoserahamed

# CI and release tooling: keep the reviewer who owns the pipeline.
/.github/                       @Kaoserahamed

# Backend service code and its schema/migrations.
/backend/app/                   @Kaoserahamed
/backend/tests/                 @Kaoserahamed

# Frontend application code and specs.
/frontend/                      @Kaoserahamed

# Security-relevant configuration and docs.
/docs/security/                 @Kaoserahamed
